  2→ * @fileoverview HTTP client for TPMJS.com (The NPM for AI Tools).
  3→ *
  4→ * Provides search and manifest-fetching capabilities against the TPMJS
  5→ * registry to enable dynamic MCP tool discovery and installation.
  6→ *
  7→ * @module tools/tpmjs_client
  8→ */
